<![CDATA[<h1>晋南行五首</h1><p>作者：孤筝（lvbowen040427@163.com）</p>
        
          <h2 id="序">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%ba%8f"></a>
序
</h2><p>　　国庆随《黑神话·悟空》游山西，历晋南晋城、临汾、运城三市，作诗词五首，简记之。
　　</p>
<h2 id="晋南行其一">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e6%99%8b%e5%8d%97%e8%a1%8c%e5%85%b6%e4%b8%80"></a>
晋南行·其一
</h2><p><strong>门掩残塑去，檐出金铎来。<br>
点染翠林乱，泼墨碧裙开。<br>
新枝攀朽木，老壮携幼孩。<br>
徽因应有泪，千年可留白？</strong></p>
<p><strong>孤筝<br>
2024.10.2<br>
晋城玉皇庙、府城关帝庙、青莲寺</strong></p>
<p>　　玉皇庙二十八星宿等殿均禁闪光灯，佛像隐于铁栅栏后，许些漆迹剥落，乃至缺首断足。令人遗憾。<br>
　　府城关帝庙中塑像几乎都是现代新作，手艺拙劣叫人倒胃口。倒是建筑值得一看。<br>
　　青莲寺山高路远，沿途风景极好，秋日山青水碧，少许红黄阔叶点缀其间，万里无云，是锦绣福地。<br>
<img src="/ruri-media/remote/4175125506_8591743882594811997_hu_868731a0c5079144.webp" srcset="/ruri-media/remote/4175125506_8591743882594811997_hu_382cf3553ed83066.webp 480w, /ruri-media/remote/4175125506_8591743882594811997_hu_96e5328862a6e6f.webp 960w, /ruri-media/remote/4175125506_8591743882594811997_hu_868731a0c5079144.webp 1370w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) calc(100vw - 36px), (max-width: 1100px) calc(100vw - 350px), 820px" width="1370" height="1028" alt="IMG_0808 (1).JPG" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-original-src="/ruri-media/remote/4175125506_8591743882594811997.jpg" data-original-width="1370" data-original-height="1028">

<img src="/ruri-media/remote/2744194162_13095610964182194723_hu_3c9fba4307dbad37.webp" srcset="/ruri-media/remote/2744194162_13095610964182194723_hu_b31b57e78cb9abb4.webp 480w, /ruri-media/remote/2744194162_13095610964182194723_hu_5d1d8d3e95d5967b.webp 960w, /ruri-media/remote/2744194162_13095610964182194723_hu_3c9fba4307dbad37.webp 1370w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) calc(100vw - 36px), (max-width: 1100px) calc(100vw - 350px), 820px" width="1370" height="1028" alt="IMG_0836 (1).JPG" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-original-src="/ruri-media/remote/2744194162_13095610964182194723.jpg" data-original-width="1370" data-original-height="1028">

